    "markdown": "# Logical\n![](/images/logical.png){style=\"width:200px; background:white; border-radius:15px; border: white solid 5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n<u id='logical_tooltip'>__Logical__</u> values can be __TRUE__ or __FALSE__. \n\nThey are primarily used when comparing objects.\n\n## Numerical comparisons\n\nRun the below commands to output <u id='logical_tooltip'>__Logical__</u> values using the various __<u id='logical_tooltip'>logical</u> <u id='operator_tooltip'>operators</u>__.\n\n::: {.callout-note}\nWhen `!` is used in <u id='operator_tooltip'>__operators__</u> it means \"not\". When used, `!` always goes at the front of the operator.\n:::\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n#Logical\n# 2 less than 4 \n2 < 4\n# 2 greater than 4\n2 > 4\n# 2 less than or equal to 4\n2 <= 4\n# 2 greater than or equal to 4\n2 >= 4\n# 2 equal to 4\n2 == 4\n# 2 not equal to 4\n2 != 4\n```\n:::\n\n\nIt is probably not immediately obvious how useful <u id='logical_tooltip'>__logicals__</u> are, but you'll see their usefulness later in the course.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-f31bb1d5dd2331076bc3\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-f31bb1d5dd2331076bc3\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-be6e49362bef0c5e7253\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-be6e49362bef0c5e7253\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-c32ed2bc4ac7fce36704\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-c32ed2bc4ac7fce36704\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-405a9f0642b783c3fbdc\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-405a9f0642b783c3fbdc\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-dbd9263eee9858f20041\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-dbd9263eee9858f20041\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-7abcaa0ddb7966d775aa\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-7abcaa0ddb7966d775aa\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-c98c623ab5d3aec32791\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-c98c623ab5d3aec32791\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"double_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number with decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1cda8024663046d6e3dd\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1cda8024663046d6e3dd\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-27bf910ef5a20e9d139a\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-27bf910ef5a20e9d139a\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"logical_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"TRUE or FALSE\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-9a98843c37773c0651c5\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-9a98843c37773c0651c5\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"scalar_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"A single value in a object\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a286785e1634b0d08f04\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a286785e1634b0d08f04\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"vector_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogenous 1-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-fd033ced2d755982375a\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-fd033ced2d755982375a\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"matrix_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogeneous 2-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"382px\" id=\"htmlwidget-919d404b756fff908c64\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-919d404b756fff908c64\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_frame_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Heterogeneous 2-dimensional data structure. Each column is homogeneous\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
